WEBVTT

03:33.573 --> 03:36.159
ROBB: Any man of the Night's Watch
is welcome at Winterfell.

03:36.284 --> 03:38.870
Any man of the Night's Watch,
but not I, eh, boy?

03:38.995 --> 03:41.247
I'm not your boy, Lannister.

03:41.372 --> 03:43.458
I'm Lord of Winterfell
while my father is away.

03:43.583 --> 03:46.836
- Then you might learn a lord's courtesy.
- (DOOR OPENS)

03:49.547 --> 03:50.799
So it's true.

03:52.717 --> 03:54.928
Hello, Bran.

03:55.053 --> 03:57.347
Do you remember anything
about what happened?

03:57.472 --> 03:59.891
He has no memory of that day.
